# Terraform - all directories (providers, state, variables)
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example

# Explicit terraform directories
terraform-oci/.terraform/
terraform-oci/.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform-oci/terraform.tfstate
terraform-oci/terraform.tfstate.backup
terraform-oci/*.tfvars
terraform-aws/.terraform/
terraform-aws/.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform-aws/terraform.tfstate
terraform-aws/terraform.tfstate.backup
terraform-aws/*.tfvars

# Backup folder terraform files (LARGE BINARIES)
backup/terraform-aws/.terraform/
backup/terraform-aws/terraform.tfstate
backup/terraform-aws/terraform.tfstate.backup

